      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll check the working directory for the compile script.Now I have a clear picture. The original test packs all 6 assertions into long single-line calls with opaque hex strings. I'll improve it by:\n1. Extracting each hex/plaintext pair into descriptive constants\n2. Adding a small helper to reduce boilerplate in each assertion\n3. Breaking assertions to multiple lines`COMPILE_OK` — the improved test compiled successfully."
